Synthesis:
As of August 29, 2026, the weather in Tokyo is cool and rainy, with temperatures hovering around 68 degrees Fahrenheit (20 degrees Celsius) [1][2]. Observations report high humidity levels between 83 percent and 95 percent [1][2][3]. The city is experiencing light to moderate rain, with some forecasts noting a temperature drop to around 20-21 degrees Celsius (approximately 68-70 degrees Fahrenheit) by the evening [1][3][4]. Winds are generally light, blowing from the north or northeast at speeds around 2 to 9 miles per hour [1][2][3][4].

